<title>SINGAPORE: Winfoong ups stake in Hong Fok.</title>
<headline>Winfoong ups stake in Hong Fok.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore property group Hong Fok Corp Ltd said in a statement on Monday that associated Hong Kong-based firm Winfoong Holding Ltd had increased its stake in the company to 22 percent from 12.75 percent.</p>
<p>Winfoong paid Singapore $3.255 per share.</p>
<p>Hong Fok shares closed on Monday at S$2.88, up one cent.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65) 870-3080</p>
</text>
